// COM745 university graph (synthetic data, the same people as university_db and uni_db).
// Neo4j Browser: paste the whole file into the editor and run it.
//   (If only the first statement runs, turn on Settings > "Enable multi statement query editor".)
// cypher-shell:  cypher-shell -u neo4j -p <your password> -f university_graph.cypher
// Running it again deletes EVERYTHING in the database first, then rebuilds the graph.
// Nodes: 6 Lecturer, 3 Course, 6 Module, 24 Student. Relationships: 3 COORDINATES, 6 TEACHES, 12 INCLUDES, 24 ENROLLED_ON, 26 REGISTERED_ON.

